{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"センター試験一日目お疲れ様ですヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の親友も今日試験だったんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日頑張れ〜って応援しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ほっと一息かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もある方もう一踏ん張りですねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいえいおー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/01/18/5329192/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ生駒ちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JINSだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"度入りメガネ5個もってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊達メガネは6個。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サングラスは2個。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ大好き〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は握手会(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょいロックな猫で待ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガネ持ってこ〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースフィルムZ見てるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいい〜(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかし、ゾロとサンジの強さ異常！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能力者倒せるてどんだけなんよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画館にも見に行ったんだ〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりですが、ノギメイトでの企画で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『デビュー10周年記念黒執事原画展〜枢 やなの世界〜』に行ってまいりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんと若様と！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武池袋本店で開催されております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒執事は私の理想が全て詰まってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"執事が好きで、理想の執事がセバスチャン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画集買いましたが、一瞬にして私の心を奪っていきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"枢やなさんありがとうございます(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミュージカルも見に行ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしかったな〜(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやらないかな〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画はどんな感じだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行こう〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}